## A Complete ChatGPT-Like Interface for Your Enterprise

{% imageRight imageSrc="/img/screenshots/why/weather-chat.png" imageAlt="Pika chat interface example" %}

Pika gives you a ready-to-deploy chat application interface (think ChatGPT UI) plus the complete backend infrastructure to power AI agents that expose your enterprise data, APIs, and business logic.

**What you get out of the box:**

- **Chat interface** - Professional chat UI that works standalone or embedded in your apps
- **Agent backend** - Infrastructure to run AI agents powered by AWS Bedrock
- **Enterprise security** - Authentication integration, access control, multi-tenancy
- **Admin tools** - Manage users, chat apps, and monitor all interactions
- **Built for AWS** - Deploys to your AWS account with full control

Deploy in days. Serve internal employees, external customers, or both.

{% /imageRight %}

---

## What Makes Pika Different

{% card title="Built on AWS, Built to Scale" icon="approve-check" %}
AWS does the heavy lifting with Bedrock, Lambda, DynamoDB, and OpenSearch. You get enterprise-scale infrastructure without the complexity. No servers to manage, automatic scaling, and pay-per-use pricing.
{% /card %}

{% card title="Complete Front and Back End" icon="rocket" %}
Production chat interface, admin site, authentication integration, and operational tooling all included. Stop building infrastructure and start building intelligence.
{% /card %}

{% card title="Agent-as-Config: Keep Your Codebase Clean" icon="puzzle" %}
Define agents as configuration deployed from your existing microservices. Your business logic stays in your services. No need to code in our codebase. Your AI IP is protected as configuration, independent of any framework.
{% /card %}

{% card title="From Toy to Tool" icon="star" %}
Self-correcting response loops, AI-generated feedback, automatic insights, and instruction engineering tools help transform shiny demos into reliable products your users depend on.
{% /card %}

---

## For Every Team, Every Use Case

{% steps %}
1. **Product Teams**
   
   Ship AI features in weeks, not months. Get real user feedback immediately. Professional UI that matches modern expectations. Analytics to understand what users are actually doing.

2. **Engineering Teams**
   
   Deploy using familiar AWS CDK patterns. Clean separation of concerns. Observable and debuggable with CloudWatch and X-Ray. No new operational model to learn.

3. **Organizations**
   
   Build for internal employees and external customers from the same deployment. Multi-tenancy, fine-grained access control, compliance ready. Scale from startup to enterprise.
{% /steps %}

---

## What You Get

### Production-Ready UI
A world-class chat interface that works standalone or embedded in your applications. Streaming responses, file upload, session history, mobile-responsive, accessibility compliant.

### Enterprise Security
Pluggable authentication, user type management, entity-based access control, role-based permissions, audit logging, and secure session management all included.

### Operational Intelligence
Self-correcting responses, LLM-generated feedback, AI-driven insights, detailed traces, and admin interface. Everything you need to run AI in production.

### AWS Foundation
Lambda, DynamoDB, OpenSearch, Bedrock, API Gateway, and EventBridge configured and integrated. Infrastructure that scales to millions of users with 99.9%+ uptime.

---

## When to Choose Pika

Pika is the right choice when:

- You're building on AWS or planning to
- You need production quality, not just demos
- You want clean architecture with clear boundaries
- You're planning multiple chat apps or agents
- Time to market matters

